WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.458
As we saw in the previous verse,

2
00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.583
Lord Krishna explained why He is sharing this

3
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:36.916
divine knowledge with Arjuna.

4
00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:38.000
In this verse, He describes

5
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.250
the greatness of

6
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.250
this knowledge itself –

7
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.458
He explains, what makes it truly glorious.

8
00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:48.791
Let us understand this more deeply.

9
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.791
Knowledge that gives life true meaning,

10
00:00:56.791 --> 00:00:58.458
purifies the heart,

11
00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.666
and fills the soul with joy –

12
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.208
is that possible?

13
00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:03.375
Absolutely yes.

14
00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:05.083
And it is this very knowledge

15
00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:06.750
that Lord Krishna calls ‘raja-vidya’ –

16
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.166
the king of all knowledge.

17
00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:11.125
This knowledge not only introduces us

18
00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:12.375
to our spiritual existence

19
00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:15.041
and worldly truth,

20
00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:17.125
but also shows us

21
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.166
a natural yet profound path

22
00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:22.125
to connect with Lord Krishna.

23
00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:25.041
Lord Krishna also calls 
it ‘the knowledge of kings’ –

24
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:27.833
because righteous kings of the past

25
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:31.208
lived by this knowledge.

26
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:32.458
Even while engaged

27
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:33.500
in worldly duties,

28
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.250
they always felt

29
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.375
Lord Krishna within their hearts.

30
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:39.416
This knowledge is not merely intellectual –

31
00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:44.666
it is an experience that gives
 life the right direction

32
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:47.208
and connects us to Lord Krishna.

33
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:49.375
It is practical,

34
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.375
supreme, and powerful.

35
00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:53.416
Lord Krishna then

36
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:56.250
calls it ‘raja-guhyam’ –

37
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.041
the greatest of all secrets.

38
00:01:59.041 --> 00:02:01.041
But why is it secret?

39
00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:02.833
Because while many people in this world

40
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:06.291
are aware of the relationship
 between the soul and the Supreme,

41
00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:08.458
very few understand

42
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.375
how deeply personal and loving

43
00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.958
a relationship with

44
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:15.416
Lord Krishna can be.

45
00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:16.416
This relationship

46
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:18.000
is not limited

47
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.958
to rituals and formalities –

48
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:22.875
it lives in faith and love.

49
00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.500
And that is why this knowledge

50
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.583
reaches only those

51
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:28.083
who approach Lord Krishna with a pure heart,

52
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:31.500
free from envy and ego,

53
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.000
in complete surrender

54
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.625
and eager to attain Krishna.

55
00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:39.791
Lord Krishna further says this knowledge is

56
00:02:39.791 --> 00:02:42.500
 ‘pavitram uttamam’

57
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.000
that is pure and supreme.

58
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.708
Because it puts an end to all of a person’s

59
00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:49.875
sins and suffering.

60
00:02:49.875 --> 00:02:52.541
Whoever connects with this path

61
00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.666
gradually begins to move

62
00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:57.208
toward excellence and joy.

63
00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:59.875
This knowledge does not just
 free us from bondage –

64
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:01.375
it transforms us

65
00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:03.416
from within.

66
00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.250
Lord Krishna says this knowledge

67
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.833
is ‘pratyakshavagamam’ –

68
00:03:07.833 --> 00:03:10.791
it can be directly experienced.

69
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:11.750
How?

70
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.291
When we chant His name,

71
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:16.208
listen to His divine pastimes,

72
00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:19.166
or lovingly serve Him –

73
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:21.916
joy begins to arise in the heart

74
00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:23.625
on its own.

75
00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:25.958
This is not just theory or thought –

76
00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:29.000
it is a living experience.

77
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.833
Just as watering the root of a tree

78
00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:35.958
nourishes all its branches, leaves, and flowers –

79
00:03:35.958 --> 00:03:36.500
Similarly,

80
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.333
devotion to Lord Krishna alone

81
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:43.500
fulfils all of life’s duties naturally.

82
00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.291
When we offer our life

83
00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.750
at the feet of Lord Krishna,

84
00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.750
all our relationships, work, and responsibilities

85
00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.500
become more organised and effortless.

86
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.333
And this path is ‘su-sukham kartum’ –

87
00:03:57.333 --> 00:04:00.833
easy and full of joy.

88
00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:04.250
No complex rituals are needed.

89
00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.916
To satisfy Krishna through devotion, 

90
00:04:06.916 --> 00:04:12.125
even a small flower, a leaf,
 or some water is enough.

91
00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:15.500
If it is offered with love and faith,

92
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.125
Lord Krishna gladly accepts it.

93
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:22.500
Therefore, this path is not difficult for anyone.

94
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.541
And this knowledge is ‘avyayam’ –

95
00:04:24.541 --> 00:04:28.041
that is eternal and indestructible.

96
00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:29.958
The love and devotion we develop

97
00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:32.291
for Lord Krishna

98
00:04:32.291 --> 00:04:34.250
never ends –

99
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.625
it brings joy to the soul

100
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:37.625
in this life

101
00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:39.458
and beyond death too.

102
00:04:39.458 --> 00:04:42.208
Everything in this world may perish –

103
00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:46.125
but devotion always remains.

104
00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:51.041
And it becomes the source
 of infinite peace and fulfilment.

105
00:04:55.916 --> 00:05:00.291
Material or spiritual knowledge,

106
00:05:00.291 --> 00:05:02.458
is truly valuable

107
00:05:02.458 --> 00:05:05.916
only when it brings change within you.

108
00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:08.625
Material knowledge makes you skilled.

109
00:05:08.625 --> 00:05:10.125
It teaches new techniques,

110
00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:13.375
helps solve problems,

111
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:16.041
and leads you to success.

112
00:05:16.041 --> 00:05:20.708
But

113
00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:24.833
even after material success,

114
00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:27.833
that knowledge remains incomplete

115
00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:30.583
if it is generating ego, selfishness,

116
00:05:30.583 --> 00:05:33.791
and restlessness within you.

117
00:05:33.791 --> 00:05:36.083
Think of it this way –

118
00:05:36.083 --> 00:05:37.416
That your life

119
00:05:37.416 --> 00:05:41.000
without this knowledge is like a mirror

120
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.000
covered in dust.

121
00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.833
When you clean it

122
00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:49.208
with spiritual knowledge,

123
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:53.333
everything becomes clear.

124
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:54.833
The value of any knowledge

125
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:57.958
is measured by its impact.

126
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:01.416
If knowledge is making you materially rich

127
00:06:01.416 --> 00:06:03.333
but creating inner unrest

128
00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:05.750
and dissatisfaction,

129
00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.666
then that knowledge is incomplete.

130
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:12.500
Now ask yourself –

131
00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.250
is the knowledge you are gaining

132
00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:19.083
truly changing you from within?

133
00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:23.875
If not, then I say to you –

134
00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:26.458
read the Bhagavad Gita.

135
00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:29.875
Bring its wisdom into your life.

136
00:06:29.875 --> 00:06:30.958
Because

137
00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:32.375
this is not merely a scripture

138
00:06:32.375 --> 00:06:36.583
or a religious book – instead

139
00:06:36.583 --> 00:06:40.916
it is a divine light that shows you how to live

140
00:06:40.916 --> 00:06:43.208
a pure and meaningful life.

141
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:51.500
In most families, spirituality is often seen

142
00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.625
as a complex and burdensome process –

143
00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:56.458
something you must follow

144
00:06:56.458 --> 00:06:59.750
whether you feel like it or not.

145
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.500
And because of these rules and formalities,

146
00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.500
children and young people

147
00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.125
tend to drift away from it.

148
00:07:08.125 --> 00:07:11.625
But can devotion to God

149
00:07:11.625 --> 00:07:14.916
truly be complicated and burdensome?

150
00:07:14.916 --> 00:07:16.791
No!

151
00:07:16.791 --> 00:07:19.291
I Myself say –

152
00:07:19.291 --> 00:07:23.291
devotion is su-sukham kartum –

153
00:07:23.291 --> 00:07:28.166
simple and full of joy.

154
00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:29.458
So

155
00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:32.458
where is the problem?

156
00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:34.166
The problem is that

157
00:07:34.166 --> 00:07:34.916
you have come

158
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:39.208
to see devotion as a difficult and rigid duty,

159
00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:40.958
rather than doing it

160
00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:43.916
with love and enthusiasm.

161
00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:48.083
Celebrate festivals not just as tradition,

162
00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:51.208
but with love and sincerity.

163
00:07:51.208 --> 00:07:53.541
Enjoy the music, dance,

164
00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:56.000
and storytelling that come with them.

165
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.250
When you embrace spirituality

166
00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.541
with love and faith

167
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:01.833
in your life,

168
00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:04.000
joy begins to pour

169
00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.041
into your home.

170
00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:07.166
Remember –

171
00:08:07.166 --> 00:08:11.666
spirituality is not just a formality.

172
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:14.875
It is a path that makes life beautiful

173
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:18.375
and relationships deeper.

174
00:08:23.125 --> 00:08:24.750
Knowledge is not just a means

175
00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.500
of gaining information –

176
00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:30.250
it is an extraordinary means

177
00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.041
of bringing change.

178
00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:36.083
And knowledge that carries this power

179
00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:40.541
never feels like a burden.

180
00:08:40.541 --> 00:08:42.000
When I gave Arjuna

181
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.458
knowledge, My purpose

182
00:08:44.458 --> 00:08:47.875
was not just to inform him –

183
00:08:47.875 --> 00:08:48.750
But

184
00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.750
it was to transform his life.

185
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.500
That knowledge filled him with clarity,

186
00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.083
joy, and confidence.

187
00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:02.500
In the same way, when you 
guide someone in your field of work,

188
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.500
then think,

189
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.416
are you just passing on information,

190
00:09:09.416 --> 00:09:12.291
or are you truly inspiring them?

191
00:09:12.291 --> 00:09:14.583
Imagine

192
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:16.833
An organization head,

193
00:09:16.833 --> 00:09:18.500
only gives

194
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.000
instructions to his team. The other

195
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:26.041
explains, teaches,

196
00:09:26.041 --> 00:09:29.000
and motivates his team

197
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.375
with proper guidance.

198
00:09:30.375 --> 00:09:31.791
The first leader’s team

199
00:09:31.791 --> 00:09:35.500
focuses only on completing the work.

200
00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:39.166
The second leader’s team

201
00:09:39.166 --> 00:09:43.000
finds joy in the work itself

202
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.375
and moves forward with confidence.

203
00:09:46.375 --> 00:09:49.625
That is the difference between
 merely giving information

204
00:09:49.625 --> 00:09:53.958
and sharing knowledge with genuine care.

205
00:09:53.958 --> 00:09:57.625
When knowledge is given
 with the right intention,

206
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:00.875
it no longer feels like a burden –

207
00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:05.208
it becomes a joyful process.
